  <para style="h">Aibraniyi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aibraniyi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aibraniyi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aib</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aibraniyi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kpmasnui: Əwo Nugwnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />N sapa, Shekwoyi ɓə daɓo n əyi azakwoyii fyi n sheaɓəgwognayi agbe nu, n asai mwa bəgyé jesnu n azokwoi gbowogbowo. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Ama fyi n anyipyei kpmaknayi ye, wo kwu əɓo da n yii dna n əwo Nugwnu Yeisu, əza, n wo ɓə knyí wo gnyi əgwúgyiyi tu n anya vnyanya jesnu n wo ɓə je anyìpata zhni n əwoi nu. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Nugwnu nu zhni nasheya Shekwoyi latu nya jesnu əwo dogbe cimcim shi wo wu, n anyai wnafyi vnyanya n əwo akwnu, n əwo ɓədagbma kalá nyai. She wo ɓə la pwo aleifyi pmyapmya tnutnu, waa sasetu n Latu Duduyi ɓwaizheɓwa dna n əshemi.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nugwnu du amaləka lo n mwamwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Ntulonu, wo ɓə la zè əza n wo du amaləka n mwamwa, n ɓwasnu ngye əye n wo ɓə gyi əkwo əgwú nyi, kwo ɓə du əɓa nya.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Ntuge knyi maləka nu lo n Shekwoyi ɓə kwu shni wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ho zhni əmi Nugwnu nu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">n naiye, mi la zhni əho Dada a?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Kwo jesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Mi ɓə la zhni əwo Dada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">jesnu əwohni wo ɓə la zhni əmi Nugwnu a”?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Njesnu, she Shekwoyi ɓe n əwo əɓyikpmisnuii dna n anyì, wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Fa Shekwoyi amaləka vnyanya ɓa ga wo mwamwa.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Shi wo ɓə daɓo tu n amaləka ɓo, wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Wo kwu əwo amaləka zè azafnu, jesnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">əwo atnutnuyi, ana nyitala.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ama ntu n Nugwnu ɓo wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Əho əbeshnikpegye, O Shekwoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">kwo ɓə la gnyi nyalonyalo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">jesnu bwusi ɓəfyecezhni nya nu ɓə la zhni bwusi əho əbemi nya.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ho la ye n ɓəfyecei jesnu hoi wnunu n əkpízhnii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">ntucenu Shekwoyi, əho Shekwoyi, wo la ho latu tu n əho anugwnudo she</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">woi pmya ho n omi bwugba bwuibwui nyai.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Njesnu wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“N kpmisnuyi, O Dagayi, ho ɓə kwu ashnipa zhi n anyì,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">jesnu n ashebmana, ɓa zhni əho aɓwa tnutnu nu.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ɓa ɓə kwu zhniagbma, ama əhoo da cegnyi lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">əɓa vnyanya ɓa ɓə kwu kwo ngye əje<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ho ɓə kwu ɓa kpmi ngye əje-kpadalai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">a ɓə la ɓa shnado ngye jekpe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ama ho to ɓə shnado m</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">jesnu əho aye taa shnazo m nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Shekwoyi wo kwu shni knyi maləkai nu gna ge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“La sasetu n əmi ɓwaizhe ɓwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">nya əsa n mi ɓə kwu əho anuwnuyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">zè əho apitakpeba a”?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Amaləka vnyanya zhni azafnu aɓəvyitnutnuyi nu, n a ɓai tnu tnutnu, ɓa zhni aza yi tnutnu n ɓa ɓə gyi əgwú gnyignyi nya nyi.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù nge yi kwu tnubwakna ga Shekwoyi ɓədagbma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ntucenu, kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ya kwu tnubwakna dəidəi n ənya n yi kwu wo nyi, nabai n yi ta kwnuya n ofye m.<verse eid="HEB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Ntuge shikwonyi ɓədatnu n amaləka nu ɓə da n əɓa agbei nyi, kwo ɓə myishì n kalái, jesnu ge owa gnanaznu dəhodəhoi n tnaɓəgbetuvyi, ɓa ɓə la əɓa tata gwo she kwo kwnuce, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />to, yi ɓə pwo n wunanu, n ya gnyignyi yaakwo ye knyiawyeya a? Gnyignyi ye, n Dagayi nu ɓə kpmi kwo wyidna nyi, jesnu aza n ɓa ɓə wo əwo nyi, ɓa ɓə la əkwo ɓəgbmi ga yi nge gaiciya nu. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Shekwoyi ce, waa əkwo ɓəgbmi n aznùi, n aɓoawowoi, n aɓəwowoizhnii gbowogbowo, n Zafnu Gyigyiyi anyagai n wo ɓə gná shi əwo ɓəye ɓə nyi.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A la Yeisu zhni zanyikwoci kpəcikpəcí</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Wo to ɓə dna anyì, n ɓa ɓe lo nyi, n amaləka akwnu nu, n yi da əkwo əɓo nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Ama abaho lo n əzaho wo la ɓəgbmi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Zanyikwoci zhni knyii nu hoi zhni wo nubwo a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">kwo əza nugwnu n ho gye əho anuwna n woi a?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ho ɓə zhni wo n gna amaləka gba fyewyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">haa fnunyi latu nya n mwamwa nyai kwnu wo.<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Njesnu ho la nyahonyahoi dna n əwo apitabwada snuta.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Shi wo ɓə kwu nyahonyahoi fyi n əwo snuta, Shekwoyi to ɓə knyí nyaho ya, n wo to ɓə dna kwo n əwo akwnu m. Dudulonu nsaiye, yi too gye nyahonyahoi n dna n əwo akwnu kpa m. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ama yi gye Yeisu əwye lo, n a ɓə la wo zhni n gna amaləka gba dna əsa fyewyi nyi, nsaiye a la fnunyi latu n mwamwa nyai kwnu wo, ntuge wo ɓə kwu əfyi azhnìgye wo, nabai ntu Shekwoyi shebmyashi ɓo, wa to əfyi wo ntu zahozahoyi ɓo.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Shekwoyi ɓə gye kwo bmya, ntu əza ɓo, jesnu n əzai n a n nyahonyahoi zhnignyi ntu əwo əɓo nu nyi, nabai wa loɓe n anugwnui ɓədo n anyigwnui n mwa bəgyé fyi n latu; wa zhni əɓa ɓəyaya gnyignyi nya n nunui, ntu azhnìgye ɓo n wo ɓə gye nyi. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Əza n wo zhni aza ɓa kwu zhni agyigyiyi, n azai n a kwu ɓa zè agyigyiyi, əɓa ɓo pá lo n abagbmanyi nu. Ntulonu vnyinkwo ta wo Yeisu lo wa yì ɓa ge amadoi n amapwii m. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Mi ɓa da əho əye əɓo n əmi amaje aba n amapwuyii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">dna n azayezhi, mi ɓa kwoanyi əho cici nya.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Njesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Mi ɓa əmihni kpema n wo”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Njesnu wo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Mi gnyi nyi, n aɓyii n Shekwoyi wo kwu ga mi nyi.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Shikwonyi aɓyi n nayii lo n amii, əwohni ce, wa lá əɓa zanyikwoci nayi pya, nabai ge dna n əwo əfyi, wo ɓa myi wa bma əza yi kala ya, n wo nu n əfyi kalái shi nyi; əwo nu zhni Shetam, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />njesnu waa aza yi loya, n a ɓə n ɓai fyi n fyenu tnutnu ń əɓa anyìgyi əsa vnyanya, ntu əfyi dnawo əɓo nyi. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Ntuge ɓəhnihni, amaləka nu to n wo bmazhni m, ama Ibrahim ayawyi nu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ntu n ɓəye ɓo, a ɓə la wo zhni ngye əɓa, n zhni zanyikwoci kpəcikpəcí n səpa dəhodəhoi, nabai n wo ɓə la zè pirisiti dnagbmai gaiciyazhninunui jesnu snusnugyei, dna n Shekwoyi tnutnuzhni, jesnu n wo ɓə myi wa ga tagbanyaga, ntu aza aleifyi ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Ntuge əwo n əwohni tukwo, wo ɓə kwu azhnìgye əsa n a ɓə mwi wo, wo ɓa myi wa bma aza yi zhni n ɓa ɓwa mwumwu nyi.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yeisu yaakwo n du Mwusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ntulonu, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwoza agyigyiyii, n yi n aɓwai kwnufyi lo n əshemi yiyì nyi, fye kwu əfye aɓənubwozhni kpe n Yeisu nu, ń yi da əwo əɓo nyi, nge əyi tnutnuloyi n pirisiti dnagbmai. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Wo ɓə zhni gbenuyi nu ga Shekwoyi n wo ɓə knyí wo nyi, n ɓwasnu shi Mwusa ɓə zhni gbenuyi nu nyi dna n Shekwoyi pwuwa vnyanya. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />A kwu gye Yeisu n kwnuce wa gwo mwamwaga n du Mwusa nya, n ɓwasnu shi pwuwa miyi n mwamwai lo n du pwuwa n kwohni nyi. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Ntuge pwuwa dəhodəhoi əzaho nu mi kwo, ama Shekwoyi nu mi nyahonyahoi. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Mwusa ɓə zhni gbenui nu ngye tnutnuyi dna n Shekwoyi pwuwa vnyanya, woi gbmiɓo tu n əɓo n Shekwoyi ɓə ye wa da n abyeɓwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ama Kirisiti zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu ngye Nugwnu dna n Shekwoyi pwuwa. Njesnu əyi nu zhni əwo pwuwa; ndei n ya kwu əyi abwugbakalafyi shiɓwa kamkam ɓədo n awyetui ədo n yi gbma ncei nyi.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù tu ntna gaiciyaga ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Ntulonu, shi Zafnu Gyigyiyi daɓo lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Nnaiye, n fya wo əwo bəgye,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />fye to kpe əfye adu akalá m</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">ngye shi fye ɓə zhni dna n tukwognanakwo nyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">dna n mwumwu əsa fyi n zhabwikawu m,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />aba n əfye azakwoyi ɓə mwi mi jesnu ɓaa mi pmigye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">kwo shikwonyi fyi n aye shiinyi yi, ɓa ɓə kwu aɓo gyewye n mi ɓə zhni nyi.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Cenu ɓə zhni ma gyi minagyi n cala yii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">ma gna, ‘Əɓa adu kwnuya lo n zokwo ciici,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">jesnu ɓa too kpe əmi azokwo əye m.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ntulonu ma kwu əɓo da n nyasii dna n əmi minagyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Ɓa taa lofyi n əmi snusnu m, nanyinanyi.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Əmi azaje n amapwuyii, fye to ye a gye əzaho dna n fye, n ədu leifyizhniyi, tnagaiciyaga nyai dna, n kwo pmyi əza ya n Shekwoyi wyewyeyida aba m.<verse eid="HEB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ama fye fyi aje bwugbakala fyegyifyegyi, əsa kwo ye ɓwagnyi lo ai yi kwo “Nnaiye,” nabai n a to ɓə gye əzaho n bwugbai kpakalá ntu leifyi kwocednadna nya ɓo m. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Yi kwu ɓe ya kwnu ɓwadodna n ajei dna n Kirisiti, ndei n ya kwu əyi bwugbaɓwato kpmisnui shiɓwa n myignyii, nya azozo ba. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Ngye shi a ye ɓwa da nyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Nnaiye, n fya wo əwo bəgye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">fye to kpe əfye adu akalá</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">ngye shi fye ɓə zhni dna n wyenakpeya nyi m.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Anyika nu ɓə n ɓai, n ɓa ɓə kwu wo, ama ɓa kwu bwugba kpakalá a? Aza yi nu to vnyanya n Mwusa ɓə kwnu ɓa n Masar nyi m? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Njesnu n anyikai nu, n wo ɓə gyi minagyi n ɓai aye shiinyi a? N aza yii nu to, n ɓa ɓə zhni leifyi nyi, n əɓa anayi ɓə zhniagbma fyi n zhabwikawu nyi m? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Njesnu n anyikai nu n Shekwoyi ɓə si nyasi, nge ɓa taa lo əwo snusnu m, nanyinanyi; n to n aza yii nu, n ɓa to ɓə vyi əwo ɓəgbetu nyi m, ma a? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Ntulonu yi kwu gyewye nge ɓa to ɓə myi ɓa lofyi m, ntu n əɓa tnagaiciyaga ɓo.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s1">Sibyiwyi-snusnu ntu Shekwoyi aza ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi ɓəgbeshi lolodna n əwo snusnu, kwo yé shilo nyi, fa ya zhni pəceye nabai to əzaho n əfye, wa gbakalá n əkwo loloi m. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Ntuge əyihni ce, a kwu nabagyi manai waazizhni ga yi, n ɓwasnu shi a ɓə zhni ga əɓa nyi. Ama waazi n ɓa ɓə wo nyi, kwo to ɓə n apmai n əɓa aba m, ntuge ɓa to ɓə kwnú ɓwadodna n aza yi gaiciyaganunui ɓəda, n ɓa ɓə kwu vyi əkwo gbetu nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Nsaiye əyi n yi kwu gaiciyaga nyi, yi lofyi lo n snusnu yi n ɓwasnu shi Shekwoyi wo kwu da nyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Ntulonu mi ɓə kwu nyasi si dna n əmi minagyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Ɓa taa lofyi n əmi snusnu m nanyinanyi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Njesnu dudulonu əwo atnutnu ɓə kwu zozhni tunyi n anyì zhni əsa. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Ntuge n abaho, Shekwoyi ɓə kwu əɓo da ntu nyipyei tnaabayi ɓo, fyi ń aɓədagbma ye: “Njesnu dna nyipyei tnaabayi Shekwoyi waa snu n əwo atnutnu vnyanya.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Njesnu dna n nyaka n kwo kpe n əshe nyi, wo gna lo, “Ɓa taa lofyi n əmi snusnu m, nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Ntucenu shi aba ye celo n azaho ɓa lofyi n snusnu yi nyi; ama shikwonyi aza yi n a ɓə kwu nabagyi manai waazizhni ga ɓa n sapa nyi, ɓa to ɓə lofyi m, ntu n əɓa tnaɓəgbetuvyi ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Shekwoyi njesnu wa shi nyipyei ədo woi yi kwo nge, “N naiye.” Wo ɓə zhni dəye, əsai la shedna n mwa, she wo ɓə daɓo n Dawuda əgbei, ngye nyaka n a la əkwo əɓo shniznu, a kwu da ge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Nnaiye, n fya wo əwo bəgye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">fye to kpe əfye adu akalá m.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Ntuge ndei Joshuwa ɓə gna waa snusnu ga ɓa, Shekwoyi to ɓə ɓa je nyipyei ədo ɓəda da, dna n əsado ntu əwyido ɓo m. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Nlonu, Sibyiwyi-snusnu ye shilo ntu Shekwoyi aza ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Ntuge zahozahoyi n wa lodna n Shekwoyi snusnu, wo ɓaa snu ce n əwohni atnutnu, n ɓwasnu shi Shekwoyi ɓə snu n əwo atnutnu nyi. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Ntucenu, fa ya əyihni mwakpe ya lofyi n snusnu yi, nabai to əzaho woi ɓwu ntu n əɓa ɓədogbe tnaɓəgbetuvyi nya ɓo m.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Ntuge Shekwoyi ɓədagbma kwo n wyewyeyi lo jesnu kwoi zhni tnutnu. Kwo gyígyíyi n du əbeyaakwo agbe-abada dəhodəhoi. Kwo byidna kwa gna bwugba ajeya n zafnui, akpi n lómwui; kwo da aɓənubwozhni owa n ədu alui. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Nyaho to lo n anyazhnizhni vnyanya n kwo ɓwushi lo n Shekwoyi awyeba m. Nyahonyahoi n kpekpeiya wulo jesnu n wu pəipəi n əwo awyeba n kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu yii ga əkwo nyadokwu nyi.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu pirisiti dnagbmai yaakwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi yi n pirisiti Dnagbmai yaakwoi lo n wo la gwnulo əshemi, Yeisu Kirisiti Shekwoyi Nugwnu, fye fa ya kwu gaiciyaganunui shiɓwa kamkam, n yi kpema kwo nyi. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ntuge yi to n pirisiti dnagbmai nu, n wo taa myi wa kpe əyi akalágba əɓo ye m, ama yi n zaknayii lo, n a ɓə kwu wo mwi n zokwo dəhodəhoi n ɓwasnu ngye əyi; dudulonu wo to ɓə zhni leifyi m. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Ntulonu fa ya yegwu Shekwoyi əbeshnikpegye shebmyashi nya n bwugbakalai, nabai ya gwo snusnugye jesnu ya ɓwa shebmyashi kwa bma yi zhni, dna n əsa əyi apmanya.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />A knyi Pirisiti dnagbmai dəhodəhoi n aza atasni nu, jesnu a n woi knyignyi nabai wa gnyi n aza apitaɓwi nu, n aɓo n ɓa to Shekwoyi, wa ga anyaga jesnu wa ga anyakwnukwnu ntu n aleifyi ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Wo myi wa vyi n aza yii pəceye n ɓa to n gənyikpei lo m jesnu ɓai ɓwu zokwo, shikwonyi əwo n wohni wo ɓa myi wa gbakalá. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Cenuzhni kwonyi zhni ɓəshishi nu wa ga anyakwnukwnu ntu əwohni aleifyi ɓo, n kwnusnu n aza aleifyii. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Njesnu əzaho to lo n wo la mwamwa ye ga əwohni m, ama wo gwo kwo əsa n Shekwoyi nu yi wo n ɓwasnu shi a ɓə yi Haruna nyi.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />N ɓwasnu n zokwo ye, Kirisiti to ɓə la mwamwa ye ga əwohni nge wo la zè pirisiti dnagbmai m. Ama Shekwoyi wa gna wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Ho zhni əmi Nugwnu nu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">N naiye mi la zhni əho Dada.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ngye shi wo ncei da lo n ɓwado,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Ho zhni pirisiti nu nyalonyalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">n kwo vyi Myelkizedek ofye.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Fyi n Yeisu anyipyei anyìgyi nya dna n əknyi, wo ɓə kwu aduwazhni n awyegyii n ɓwucii n awyenyii ga əza n wo ɓə ɓa myi wa gnyi wo n əfyi, jesnu a kwu əwo aduwazhni wo, ntu n əwohni gaga ɓo dna n tukwogba. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Kwo shikwonyi wo ɓə zhni Nugwnu nu, wa tu ɓəgbetuvyi mwi n əɓo n wo ɓə gyeazhnì n əkwo ɓo nyi, <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />jesnu, shi a ɓə zè n əwo nunui zhnii, waa zè zokwo gnyignyi nyalonyalo nya ga aza vnyanya n ɓa vyi wo ɓəgbetu. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Njesnu Shekwoyi ɓə n woi knyignyi ntuge waa zhni pirisiti dnagbmai vyi Myelkizedek ofye.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù ntu myimyiya ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Yi n aɓoi lo n mwa n yi ɓa da tu n ɓəye tukwo, ama kwo dnaɓo lo, n yi ɓa wu fye kwo pəipəi ntuge fye to ye yì əfyehni lo fya ɓwa awyega m. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Ɓəhnihni, fye kwnuce lo, fye ye zhni anyawuyi nu nsaiye, ama fye ye n apmai lo əzaho wa wu fye aɓoɓyiɓyii Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nya n shnasnusnu. Fye ye ɓeɓegbma nu, toge nyagyi kpokəloi m!<verse eid="HEB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Zahozahoyi n wo ye yé ɓeɓelo, wo ye zhni əɓyi-pwutu nu, wo too dami n nyawui tu n ɓəfyece tukwo m.<verse eid="HEB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ama nyagyi kpokəloi zhni aza akpikwoi nya nu, aza n ɓa zhni apma n kwoi ciici, ɓa la əɓahni ta nabai ɓa kpe əɓo manai n kakayi n əɓo nukwoii.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Ntucenu yi kwu nyawu ayayaba nya, ntu Kirisiti ɓo ga avnu, ya gyiabye lo da akpikwokwo, toge ya je lo yii ya shnipa shishi ntu abwuye ntu atnutnu afyífyiyi ɓo, ɓədo n gaiciyaganunui dna n Shekwoyi m, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />kwo gbega ntu n batizima ɓo, ɓədo n aɓwakpei n tukwo, əfyikalakwu jesnu n owada nyalonyalo nyai m. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />N Shekwoyi wa ye, yi ɓa gyiabye ya zhni nlonu.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Kwo taa kpeyezhni m, nanyinanyi, nge aza yi n ɓa kwu bwuznagna ɓwa n əsa ho, n ɓa kwu əshemi nyaga towo, n ɓa kwu Zafnu Gyigyiyi kwnutowo n azajei, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />aza n ɓa kwu Shekwoyi ɓədagbma shebmyashi nya towo, ɓədo n kalái cala nya n kwo ɓəlo nyi; <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />n ɓa la myiya, n a ɓa je ɓa gwo fyi n abwuye m. Ɓa kwu Shekwoyi Nugwnu je znudu nu n shnasnusnu, fyi n əɓa nuwnaɓwi jesnu ɓai dna wo vnyinkwo pəipəi gnyi n bəgye.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Əknyi n kwo sni əgbma nuwna n kwo zhi kpe kwo ciici nyi, kwoi ɓe n nyagyii ga aza yi n ɓa nu ofwa nyi, kwo gwo Shekwoyi anabəlika. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ama əknyi n kwo kwnu aknawui nu ɓe ncei n agbegbe nukwoii, kwo zhni gbəloi nu, jesnu kwo dnalo n azhnìgye knyitu nya. N kpmasnu a ɓə kpe kwo əná.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Əmi anugwnudo ayeyei, kwo shikwonyi yi daɓo lo nlai, kwo la yi kwnuawye nge anya amanai lo ntu n əfye ɓo; anya n ɓa todo lo n gnyignyii. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Shekwoyi to zhni əza tnagaiciyada nu m, wo taa zè əfye tnutnu amwi n yeyei n fye kwu wu wo, shi fye bma əwo aza zhni, fyenyi ye gyiabye lo fyei bma ɓa zhni nyi. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Yi ye zahozahoyi n əfye, wa wu wyenyi gbmanyigbmanyi ye, nya azoba, nabai ənya n fye n awyetui lo n kwo nyi, n fye ɓə ɓwa kwo ń nunui. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Yi ta ye lo fya kwu zè aɓwatoyi m, ama fye shna aza yi n ɓa ɓə kwu əgwú ɓwa fyi n gaiciyaganunui n bwugbaɓwai, shi a ɓə n ɓəgbeshii shi nyi.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi ɓəgbeshi tnadoshnai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />She Shekwoyi ɓə la ɓəgbeshi shi Ibrahim, shikwonyi əzaho to ɓə nyi n du əwo, n wo ɓa si nyasi n əwoi m, wa si nyasi n əwohnii, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Woi gna, “Ɓəhnihni mi ɓə tu ho anabəlika, mii ga ho ayawyii n mwa bəgyé.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ntulonu, shi Ibrahim ɓə la pmignyi n bwugbaɓwai, waa ənya gwo n a ɓə ga wo əkwo ɓəgbeshi nyi.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Aza si nyasi n əzai nu n wo du ɓa, jesnu nyasí myi əɓo gnyi, n a kwu da, jesnu kwa zo aɓənakpeaje vnyanya. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Ntuge Shekwoyi ɓə ncei pma wa wu əwo ɓəmwi tnadoshnai nyinyì nu pəipəi, n əgwúgyiyi aba ənya n wo ɓə la kwo shigbe nyi, waa kwo myignyi n nyasíi. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Shekwoyi ɓə zhni dəye nabai n anya ngwnu-aba tnadoshnai, n kwo taa kpeyezhni Shekwoyi wa ceakata nyi m, əyi n yi la bwusi lo yi taɓwashi awyetu n ɓa shignyi n əyi abye nyi, n yi ɓa myi ya ɓwa agwumyi yaakwo. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Yi n awyetu yei lo n əkwo nu zhni zhigwo ntu wyewyeyi ɓo, kwo myignyi lo jesnu n əkwohnii wnashi. Kwo lodna n nyakwnugyigyiyi əmiimì nu, ń əjesasai avnu, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />aba n Yeisu əyi gnabye ɓə lodna n əyi apitaɓwi nyi. Wo la zè pirisiti dnagbmai nyalonyalo nya, vyi Myelkizedek ofye.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Myelkizedek Shekwoyi Pirisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Myelkizedek ye nu ɓə zhni əsu Salem nya, jesnu pirisiti Shekwoyi Ikwoda Duduyi Vnyanya nya. Wo ɓə shegwnu Ibrahim woi zhi okwusnu nu, woi kwu nasalagyi tu ń asu aje, wa tu wo anabəlika. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Njesnu Ibrahim wa ga wo zaka (okwu gbmanyi n akwu ngwnu-awo) n nyahonyahoi nya. Kpmisnui əye Myelkizedek awyega nyi, “Əsu ɓəfyecezhni nya” jesnu, “Əsu Salem nya.” N kwo nu gyi, “Əsu bwugbafu nya.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Ntna əda ntna əya, ntna azakwoi ofye, to ai kpe nyipyei ye n a ɓə ma wo m, kwo əwo wyewyeyi azoba m, wo gbedolo n Shekwoyi Nugwnui nu, wo zhni pirisiti nu nyalonyalo.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Zhni əɓə nubwo shi Myelkizedek ye ɓə zhni əza yaakwo nsnu. Kwo dada-zakwoi Ibrahim, wo ɓə la okwu gbmanyi n akwu ngwnu-awo ga wo ń okwnugyi nyaɓwa! <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Nsaiye, owa da ge Levyi ayawyi n ɓa ɓə kwu zhni apirisiti nyi; nge ɓa gwo okwu gbmanyi n okwu ngwnu-awo n aza aba. Ɓa gwo əkwo n əɓa Aisrailayi aje nu; kwo shikwonyi əɓa azaje zhni Ibrahim ayawyi nu cè. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Əza ye, Myelkizedek, to ɓə zhni Levyi ofye nu m, ama wo ɓə la okwu gbmanyi n okwu ngwnu-awo gwo n Ibrahim, jesnu waa wo tu anabəlika, əza n wo ɓə n aɓəgbeshii nyi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Njesnu ntna bwugba-aba, əzayaakwo nu tu əzagbagbayi anabəlika.<verse eid="HEB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Dna n ɓəho, a zhni a knyi okwu gbmanyi dna n okwu ngwnu-awo a ga apirisiti nu; aza ń əɓahni ce fyí nyi; ama n əɓədo ho gbowo, ngye Myelkizedek ɓəda nya ye, a ga əza nu n a kpəlo ge wo ye gnyilo n wyewyeyi. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Əza ɓa myi wa da nge Levyi, n wo gwo okwu gbmanyi n okwu ngwnu-awo nyi, nge wo ɓə kwu okwu gbmanyi gba ce n Ibrahim aɓwai, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />ntuge she Myelkizedek ɓə shegwnu Ibrahim, Levyi ɓə ye dna n əwo zakwoyi nayi nu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeisu gnyi ngye Myelkizedek nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Ngye a ɓə gna ge a ɓa ɓwa ɓəzhni nunui n Levyi pirisiti atnutnu ofye nu; jesnu ge ɓəhnihnii nu ge, owa n a ɓə ga aza nyi, nge, pirisiti ofye yi nu ɓə ɓa myi kwo gnyi; to, knyiɓei nu ɓə zhni ai ye zna pirisiti ədo shni wa ɓe; əza n wo gbmi n Myelkizedek ofye, toge Haruna əfye m ma? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Ntuge she a shna pirisiti ədo, ɓəshishi nu, a shna owa ədo cè. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Əza n a da aɓo ye ntu n əwo əɓo nyi, wo gbmi n əbyedo nu, toge əbye n kwo shni tnutnuzhni n bəgədi m. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Kwo wulo nlonu pəipəi nge əyi Dagayi ɓə gbmi n Yahuda əbye nu, jesnu tu n əbyeyi tukwo, Mwusa to ɓə da ɓəho ntu n apirisiti ɓo m. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Njesnu ənya n yi kwu da nyi, kwo gna wulo n awyeknayai ndei n pirisiti ədo ɓa kpeya ɓe ngye Myelkizedek, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />əza n wo la zhni pirisiti, toge n əwo azakwoyi ɓəvyi kwnunui m, ama ntu n kalá əwo wyewyeyi nya ɓo, n a taa myi n əkwo agbmazhni nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Ntuge a ncei da lo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“Ho zhni pirisiti nu nyalonyalo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:17">n kwo vyi Myelkizedek əfye.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ɓəvyi kwnunu kwokwoi, a ɓə la kwo pmyima n gnagna ntuge ɓa ɓə gbakalá jesnu n tna-apma, <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />(ntuge owa to ɓə zhni ɓəho n nunui m) jesnu a la awyetu gnabmyai əɓo ceci, ń əkwoi nu n yi ɓa wó vyivyiwyi n Shekwoyii.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Njesnu kwo to ɓə nyi ntna nyasi nu m! Azaje ɓə kwu zhni apirisiti ntna nyasi dəhodəhoi, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />ama wo ɓə zhni pirisiti n nyasii nu əsa n Shekwoyi ɓə gna wo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Dagayi wo la nyasi si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">jesnu wo ta shna əwo bwugba do m:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Ho zhni pirisiti nu nyalonyalo.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Ntu nyasi ye ɓo, Yeisu wo la zhni ɓwagwoyi ɓəgbeshi gnabmyai nya.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Nsaiye a kwu apirisiti zhni n mwa bəgyé, shi əfyi to ɓə ye ge ɓa gyiabye fyi n əɓa atnutnu nyi m, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />ama ntuge Yeisu n wyewyeyi lo nyalonyalo, wo n pirisiti-tnutnu nyalonyalo nyai shilo. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ntucenu wo ɓa myi wa gnyi aza yi n nunui, n ɓa ɓe Shekwoyi aba dna n əwo nyi, ntuge wo gnyilo ciici, wa gbimì ga ɓa.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Ɓəhnihni Pirisiti dnagbmai ye pya, wo ga yi anya n yi n əɓa apmai lo: əza n wo gyigyiyi, n tnaɓətui, n tnadodnai, n a n woi knyignyi n taya n aleifyizhniyii, n latui n kwo du ashebmana nya. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Toge ngye apirisiti adnagbmai aje m; wo to n apmai lo wa kwnu anyakwnukwnu fyegyifyegyi m, kpmisnui ntu əwohni aleifyi ɓo, nlonu ntu n aza aleifyi ɓo. Wo ɓə la ənyagbmi ntu əɓa aleifyi ɓo, əsa wo ɓə ga əwohni tukwo əɓwa znugbmanyi ntu əɓa vnyanya ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Ntuge owa tnu apirisiti adnagbmai n aza nu fyi n əɓa akalágba; ama nyasi n kwa kpma ɓe n owa avnu nyi, kwo ɓə la Nugwnu knyi, əza n a la wo zhni n nunui nyalonyalo.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Pirisiti dnagbmai ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Nsaiye əɓo kpokəloi n yi da, əkwo nu nyi: Yi n pirisiti dnagbmaii lo, n wo sasetu n əbeshnikpegye ɓwaizheɓwa Latu Duduyi nya n əshemi, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />jesnu n wo zhni tnutnu n nyakwnugyigyiyi nu, Dagayilubwui ɓəhnihni nya, n Dagayi nu ɓə shi kwo nyi, toge zanyikwoci m.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Ntuge Pirisiti dnagbmai dəhodəhoi, wo zhni knyiknyii nu, n wo ga anyaga n anya akwnukwnuii, ntulonu kwo ɓə zhni ɓəshishi nu, ntu əza dəye ɓo ce, wa ɓwa nyaho n wo ɓa ga. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Ndei wo ɓə gna wo dna n anyì nu, wo to ɓə ɓa zhni pirisiti m, ntuge apirisiti ɓə pmazhizhi n ɓa ga anyaga shi owa n əgbei ga ge a zhni. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Ɓa zhni tnutnu fyi n nyakwnugyigyiyi nu, n əkwo nu zhni dogbe jesnu jejelukwo ədo nya n kwo dna n əshemi nyi. Cenu ɓə zhni apma Mwusa ɓəkwnù, she wo ɓə ye wa mi Dagayilubwui nyi: “Zhni nyahonyahoi dəidəi ngye ofye n a ɓə wu ho kwo tu n əpe nyi.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ama ɓəhnihni; ɓəvyitnutnu n Yeisu wo la gwo nyi, kwo du əɓa nya lo ngye shi ɓəgbeshi n əwo nu zhni ɓəwnazhiyi nyi, kwo du kwokwoi nya lo, shikwonyi ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi n shi tu n aɓəgbeshi gnabmyai nu.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Ntuge nyaho to ɓə gna ge kwo wnuwnuiya lo n ɓəgbeshi kpmisnui m, a to ɓə ɓa shna zokwo ədo znashni a dna n dəye əɓwi m. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ama Shekwoyi ɓə kwu aza leifyi gye wa gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Anyipyei ɓe lo, Dagayi nu da lonu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">she mi ɓə shi ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">n Israila azai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">jesnu n Yahuda azai.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Kwo to ɓə wú ngye ɓəgbeshi nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">n mi ɓə shi əɓa azakwoyi nyi m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">əsa n mi ɓə n ɓai shiɓwa, ma gyiabye n ɓai ma kwnu ɓa ya ń Masar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">ntuge ɓa to ɓə gwodu fyi n əmi ɓəgbeshi n gbenuii m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">jesnu maa pmyiya n əɓa aba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Dagayi nu da nlonu.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Ɓəgbeshii nu nyi n mi ɓə shi kwo n Israila azai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">n əsa dəyi avnu, Dagayi nu da nlonu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Mi ɓə fyi əmi awa n əɓa aɓonubwozhni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">jesnu mii kwu ɓa kafyi n əɓa adu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Mi ɓə zhni əɓa Shekwoyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">jesnu ɓa ɓə kwu zhni əmi aza.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Aza to ɓə je əɓa kwnuzhiyi nyawu m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kwo əza woi wu əwodo, woi gna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Kpe Dagayi əye m,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">ntuge əɓa vnyanya ɓə kpe əmi əye ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ənya n kwo ya n əza gnagbagbai vnyanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kwoi lo əza yaakwo dudui.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Ntuge mi ɓə zo ɓa əɓa əkpízhni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">jesnu mi to ɓə pá əɓa aleifyi ɓo n shnasnu m.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Shi a yi ɓəgbeshi ye, “woiwoyi,” wo la kpmisnui nya zè gbəloi nuu; jesnu ənya n kwo zhni kwokwoi jesnu gbəloi; əsa fyewyi, kwo ɓa ɓwuwye.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mwamwaga dna n dagayilubwi əknyi nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />To, nsayi ye, ɓəgbeshi kpmisnui ɓə n aɓəgbekpei ntu mwamwaga ɓo ɓədo n nyakwnugyigyiyi dna n əknyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />A ɓə la dagayilubwui tu gnyi. Dna n əkwo nyakwnu kpmisnui, pyitila-kwnuyi ɓə gnyi n tebwulii shi, n əkwo biledi gyigyiyii kpe; a ɓə yi əkwo nu ge Aba Gyigyiyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />A ɓə n əjesasai baayii sa, n əkwo avnu nyakwnu baayi ɓə gnyi ai yi kwo ge Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Nyakwnu yi ɓə n bəgədi zinali anya asnida nyai shi, n akwati ɓəgbeshi nyai tu, n kwo ɓə pwipwii n zinalii nyi. Akwati ye ɓə n zinali nyikwnuɓyi manna nyai dna, n Haruna bwusii n kwo ɓə la kpmi nyi, jesnu n apaala akwuta ɓəgbeshii. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Tu n akwati she, acerubyim Latu nya ɓə kpe, n ɓa ɓə n abmyina ofnui taya kpe, kwoi pwu tagbanya n a yi kwo ge tagbanya snusnugye shnikpegye nyi. Ama yi taa da aɓo ye ɓo n shniceknyii nsaiye m.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />She a ɓəə la nyahonyahoi zhnizhi nlanyi, apirisiti ɓa lofyi n nyakwnu əbmyi nya n asa-asai ntuge ɓa zhni əɓa ɓəvyitnutnu. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ama pirisiti dnagbmai nu ɓə ɓwa lodna n nyakwnu əmiimì nya. Wo ɓə ɓwa lodna znugbmanyi nu dna n əye, toge ntna amii shii m, n wo ɓa ga ntu əwohni əɓo jesnu ntu n aza aleifyi ɓo, n ɓa kwu zhni fyi ntna gənyikpe nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Zafnu Gyigyiyi ɓə gnyi woi wu nu, dna n dəye nge, a too da zokwo əɓo n kwo lo Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi nyi kpa m, ntuge dagayilubwui kpmisnui ɓə ye gnyi kwoi zhni tnutnu. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Dəye zhni ɓəwu nu, ntu nsaiye ɓo. Kwoi wu nge n zokwo kwokwoi, anyaga ɓədo n anyakwnui n a ɓə zhni ai ga nyi, ɓa to ɓə myi ɓa kwnu ɓəgyi ya n tukwovnyi amwamwagayi m. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Ba ɓə ɓwa nyagyi əɓo nu zhni n ənyasnisniyi jesnu n akwnunu anyazhnayai gbowogbowo; aɓəgbekpe əbmyi nya ɓə ɓwa akwnunu aɓo nu zhni nya əsa n aɓəvyi woiwoyi ɓə ɓe ncei.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisiti ami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Nsaiye, Kirisiti la zhni pirisiti dnagbmai tu n anya amanai vnyanya n ɓa lo nsaiye nyi. Wo ɓə la lodna n dagayilubwui n kwo gnadu jesnu n kwo gna nunui, n a to ɓə tu kwo n zanyikwoci aɓwai nu m, n kwo to dnalo n anyazhnizhni ye m. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Wo to ɓə lodna n ɓo, n abwui amii nu kwo anakwoɓyiyi nyai m; ama wo ɓə lodna n Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi əɓwa znugbmanyi ntu aza vnyanya ɓo n əwohni amii, nlonu wa gwo shnashna nyalonyalo nya. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Abwui ami n anakwonugba nyai ɓədo n anakwoɓyiyi otnui, a myi ɓa kpe n aza yi n ɓa ɓə fyi n kwnunu atnagyiyi, nabai ɓa kwu zè agyigyiyi n əbmyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />A ɓa ka dada nge nanu, nsaiye, n Kirisiti ami ɓo a, əza n wo ɓə dna n Zafnu nyalonyalo nya, wa ga Shekwoyi əwohni n tnaɓətu, wa zhna əyi atukwovnyi ya n atnutnu n ɓa lo əfyi nyi, nabai n yi ɓa myi ya zhni Shekwoyi wyewyeyida tnutnu!<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ntu dəye ɓo, Kirisiti nu zhni ɓəwnazhiyi ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi nya, nabai nge aza yi n a la ɓa yì, ɓa myi ɓa gwo ɓəgbeshi əgwú nyalonyalo nya. Nsaiye shi wo ɓə la fyí ngye tagba nya nyi, wa la ɓa loya n aleifyi n ɓa ɓə zhni fyi n ɓəgbeshi kpmisnui snuta nyi.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />N a da əza ɓəye nu ɓo, ɓəshishi nu a gye nge əza n wo ɓə shi əwo ɓəye nyi, wo la fyí kpa, <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />ntuge əza ɓəye, kwo ɓwa tnutnu lo woi la fyí nu; kwo ta lo tnutnu əsa n əza n wa shikwonyi, woi ye gnyi n wyewyeyi m nanyinanyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ənya nu n kwo ɓə zhni, kwo ɓəgbeshi kpmisnui to kwa zhni tnutnu n tna ami m. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />She Mwusa ɓəə la owa dəhodəhoi ɓəgbetu nya dnawyi ga aza vnyanya, wa la anakwoɓyiyi ami, n nuwnai, n wulu byeii ɓədo n sooso aɓwalai, wa myi kwo kpe n əpakpmikpmii jesnu n aza vnyanya. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Wo ɓə gna, “Dəye nu zhni ami ɓəgbeshi nya, n Shekwoyi nla əgbega nge fya shiɓwa nyi.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />N zokwo ye, wa myi ami kpe n dagayilubwui ɓədo n nyahonyahoii n a ɓə zhni apma ncei ntu akwnunu ɓəzhni ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Ɓəhnihni, owa ye nge, aa nyahonyahoi zhni gyigyiyi n amii nu, jesnu n tna ami zeya, aleifyi zo to lo m.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Kwo ɓə zhni ɓəshishi nu, ǹ əsayii, ntuge əshemi anyadogbe aa ɓa pmya n anyakwnukwnu yei, ama əshemi anya, n əɓahnii, a pmya ɓa ya n anyakwnukwnui nu ń ɓa gna adəye du. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Ntuge Kirisiti to ɓə lodna n nyakwnugyigyiyi n a ɓə mi kwo n zanyikwoci aɓwai m, dogbe gaiciya nya nu ɓə ɓwasnu. Wo ɓə lodna n əshemi nu n əkwohni, nabai wa kpeyagnyi n Shekwoyi abye ntu əyi ɓo. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Wonyi to ɓə lo əshemi wa ga əwohni woi bmakpe-bmakpe nu, ngye shi pirisiti dnagbmai lodna n Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi əye dəhodəhoi n amii n ɓa to zhni əwo ənya nu nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Ntolonu m, Kirisiti ɓə ɓa kwu azhnìgye n asai mwa bəgyé, ənya n kwo laka n anyìzhni sa. Ama wo la kpeyaɓe znugbmanyi ntu n aza vnyanya ɓo n anyìzo sa, wa du aleifyi aɓoya n nyagbmii əwohni gaga nya. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />N ɓwasnu shi kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu n əza aba, wa fyi znugbmanyi jesnu n dəye avnu ai da wo owa nyi, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />ntulonu a ɓə la Kirisiti ga znugbmanyi nabai wa kwu azabəgye aleifyi ya; jesnu wo ɓə kpeyaɓe əɓwa baayi, toge woi je aleifyi kwu m, ama woi ɓe n gnyignyii ga aza yi n ɓa zhilo ɓai pmi wo.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisiti n zhni nyagbmi znugbmanyi ntu aza vnyanya ɓo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Owa ɓwa jejelukwo nu zhni anya amanai nya n ɓa ɓe lo nyi; əɓa nu to zhni aɓo hnihnii m. Ntu dəye ɓo, kwo taa yezhni, nge anyakwnukwnu gbmanyigbmanyi yezeyeze tnazoi, n kwo ɓa zhni aza yi n ɓa ɓe mwamwaga nyi, ɓa kwu zhni anunui m nanyinanyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ntolonu m, ɓa to ɓə ɓa kwu fa anyakwnukwnu ga ɓo m? Ntuge amwamwagayi ɓə ɓa kwu zè agyigyiyi n əɓwa znugbmanyi kpeekpe, jesnu ɓa to ɓə ɓa shna əɓa aleifyi ɓəgyi wo m. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ama anyakwnukwnu yi zhni aleifyi ɓəpá nya nu yezeyeze. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Kwo taa yezhni, anakwonugba ami n abwui nyai ɓa kwu aleifyi ya m.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ntucenu, shi Kirisiti ɓə ɓe dna n anyì, wa gna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Nyagbmi ɓədo n nyagai ɓa ta wo ho əpwa lo m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">ama nayi n ho la zhni ga mi nyi;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />anyaga anakpei n aleifyi anyagai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">əɓa aɓo to ɓə da ho m.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Nlonu ma gna, ‘Gye mi gnyi nyi; a ncei kafyilo n əpakpmikpmii ntu n əmi ɓo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">Əmi Shekwoyi, mi la ɓe ma zhni əho ɓəye.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Kpmisnuyi wa gna, “Anyakwnu n anyagai, anyaga nakpei ɓədo n aleifyi anyagai, əɓa əpwa ta wo ho lo m, kwo ge ho ɓə kwu əɓa agbmada wo m,” kwo shikwonyi a ɓə kwu ɓa ga shi owa ncei tu. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Nsayi wa gna, “Gye mi gnyi nyi, mi la ɓe ma zhni əho ɓəye.” Waa ɓəgbeshi kpmisnui pmyishi nabai wa shi baayi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Njesnu n tukwoi tu n ɓəye yi ɓo, a kwu yi zhni agyigyiyi ntu Yeisu Kirisiti nayi nyagbmi ɓo znugbmanyi ntu n aza vnyanya ɓo.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Fyegyifyegyi pirisiti dəhodəhoi gnyiagnyi gnyi woi zhni akwnunukwnu tnutnu; woi ga anyakwnukwnu gbmanyigbmanyi; woi bmakpe-bmakpe, n ɓa taa myi ɓa kwu aleifyi ya m nanyinanyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ama shi pirisiti ye ɓə la aleifyi nyagbmi ga znugbmanyi ntu n əsa vnyanya ɓo, waa sasetu n Shekwoyi ɓwaizhe ɓwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Njesnu ənya n kwo ɓə ya nsayi, wo gnyilo woi pmi a kwu əwo anuwnuyi zè əwo apitakpeba. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ntuge n nyagbmii gbmanyi, wo kwu aza yi zè anunui nyalonyalo nya, ń a zè ɓa agyigyiyi nyi.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Zafnu Gyigyiyi ce wo la ɓəgbmi ga yi ntu dəye ɓo. Kpmisnui wo gna:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />Dagayi da lo, “Dəye nu zhni ɓəgbeshi n mi ɓə shi n ɓai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">n dəye avnu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Mi ɓə fyi əmi awa n əɓa adu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">jesnu mii kwu ɓa kafyi n əɓa abwugba.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Nsayi wa ɓe əɓo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Əɓa aleifyi tna-owaɓwashi atnutnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">Mi to ɓə shna əɓa əɓo pá m kpeekpe.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Njesnu aba n a kwu aleifyi ye zo, leifyi nyagbmi to shnasnu lo n apmai m.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiyi ntu əmìfyi ɓo dna n gaiciyaganunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Ntucenu, əmi azaje azanugbai n anyikwozai, shikwonyi yi n bwugbakalai lo, ya lofyi n Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi ntu Yeisu ami ɓo nyi, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />n zokwo woiwoyi n wyewyeyi nyai n a la gwuya ga yi dna n əjesasai zokwo ń əkwo nu zhni əwo nayi nyi, <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />jesnu shikwonyi, yi n pirisiti yaakwoi lo dna n Shekwoyi pwuwa nyi, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />fa ya yegwu Shekwoyi n ədu hnihnii nyai, jesnu n əɓo awyekwnui n nunui fyii n gaiciyaganunui ɓe ncei nyi; ai kwu əyi adu myi ami, ɓa zhna yi ya n ɓəgyi tukwovnyi nya, jesnu a la əyi anayi zhnaya n nuwna gyigyiyii. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Fa ya kwu awyetu ye shiɓwa ntna bwugba-aba fyii, n yi da əɓa aɓo nyi, ntuge əza n wo ɓə ga yi ɓəgbeshi ye nyi, wo zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Njesnu fye fa ya zhni ɓənubwo, shi yi ɓa ceaje aɓwa fyi n yeye ɓədo n aɓo manaizhnii. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Fye to fa yezhi ɓo n abagbmanyi m, ngye shi azaho ɓa lá kwo shiɓwa ɓai zhni nyi m, ama n agwumyizhii ga aje; n gnasnusnu nsaiye, shi fye gye Nyipyei yi kwoi yawye wu ɓe nyi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />N ya gyiabye n aleifyizhniyi yii gwo kpe ge yi la gaiciyanunui yekpé gwo, nyagbmi ho to ye lo ntu n aleifyi zo ɓo m, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />ama ənya n a ɓa tuwye, əkwo nu zhni ədnawo owada nya ɓədo n minagyi əná-gwogwoi nyai, n kwo ɓə gyi Shekwoyi anuwnuyi nyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Zahozahoyi n wo ɓə la Mwusa owa aɓəna, wo ɓə la fyí ntna snusnugye tu n aseyedada n aɓəkwnuyi agbe ngwnu-aba kwo ngwnu-ata ɓəgbmi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Ho zhninubwo lo ge əza tata ɓə zhiná nsnu wunanu, n wo la Shekwoyi Nugwnu dnaya n apitai, n wo kwu ami ɓəgbeshi nya zhniagbma ngye ənya tnagyii, n əkwo nu ɓə pmya ɓa nyi, jesnu wo kwu Zafnu shebmyashi nya knyiakpmi a? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Ntuge yi kpe wo əye lo n wo ɓə gna, “Tagba zhni əmi nya nu; mi ɓə gbaɓota,” njesnu, “Dagayi ɓə da əwo aza owa.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Kwo zhni əɓo ədnawo nya nu, əza wa kaya dna n Shekwoyi wyewyeyida akwnu.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Fye pa anyipyei asapai nya ɓo, n əfye bwuznagna gwogwo avnu, she fye ɓə kwu fyimì fyi n bwugba gwnukpaje yaakwo nya, n nunui n azhnìgyei. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />N asahoi a ɓə zhni aa fye kwnuzhi n əbmyi, ai da fye aɓəda nukwoi, ai wu fye awyesnugbegye ɓo; n asahoi, fya kwu kwnuzhni n aza yii n a zhni ɓa lonu nyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Fye ɓə kwu azhnìgye n kwnusnu n azhaludai jesnu fya zhni bwugbabwui n azai n ɓa gwo əfye anyaɓwa, ntuge fye ɓə kpe nge əfye, n əfyehni, fye ɓə n anyaɓwa gnabmyai, n ɓa to zo nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Ntulonu fye to kwu əfye bwugbamyignyi ya m; ntuge a ɓə gwo kwo gyiba yaakwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Kwo gwo fya kwu əmìfyi, nabai shi fye ɓə kwu Shekwoyi ɓəye zozhni, fye ɓə gwo ənya n wo ɓə la əkwo ɓəgbeshi shi nyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Ntuge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“N ɓwasnu n əsai fyewyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">əza n wo ɓe lo nyi, wo ɓa ɓe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">jesnu wo taa gyisa m.”<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Njesnu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">“Ama əmi ɓəfyecezhniyi ɓa gyianyì n gaiciyaganunui nu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Njesnu mi taa wo agbmada</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">n əza yi n wo jeze n avnui m.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ama yi to fyilo n aza yi nu n ɓa jeze n avnui nyi, ai zhni ɓa agbma m, ama yi fyi n aza yi nu n ɓa n gaiciyaganunui lo njesnu ɓa kwu pwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Gaiciyaganunui dna n əkwo tnutnuzhni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Nsaiye gaiciyaganunui nu zhni agwumyignyi dna n ənya n yi n awyetui n kwo, jesnu aɓoawyekwnu tu ənya n yi ta gyewye lo m. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Ənya nu nyi n kwo ɓə zhni a ci azakwokwoyí.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />N gaiciyaganunui nu n yi ɓwa awyega nge a ɓə zhni anyì n Shekwoyi ɓəgbetui nu, ntuge ənya n yi gyewye nyi, a to ɓə zhni kwo n ənyai nu n a gyewye m.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Habyila wa ɓe Shekwoyi n nyaga gnabmyaii n du Kayinu nya. N gaiciyaganunui nu a ci wo ge ɓəfyeceyi, she Shekwoyi ɓə da ɓəda manai tu n əwo anyagaga ɓo. Njesnu n gaiciyaganunui, Habyila ye daɓo lo, kwo shikwonyi wo la fyí.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />N gaiciyaganunui nu aa Enok ye la n anyì ye, kwa zhni to wa to əfyi wo m: “A to ɓə je wo əwyegye m, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓə la wo la.” Ntuge a ɓə snu n a la wo nyi, a ɓə kwu wo ci nge wo zhni əza nu n wo əɓo da Shekwoyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Njesnu ntna gaiciyaganunui kwo taa yezhni əza əɓo kwa da Shekwoyi m, ntuge əza ń əwo ɓe da wo, ɓəshishi nu wa ga gaiciya nge woo lo, jesnu nge əwo nu ga aza yi gyiba n ɓa zna wo shni n əwyei bmyibmyii nyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Nuhu, she a ɓə ga wo ɓəkwnu ntu aɓo ɓo n a to ɓə gyewye kpa m, dna n ədnawo gyigyiyi nya, wa ji əya nuwnanya nabai wa gnyi əwo pwuwa. N əwo gaiciyaganunui, wa znu anyì əknyi waa zè ɓəfyece əgwú gyiyii n kwo vyi gaiciyaga nyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Ibrahim, she a ɓə yi wo ge wo lo aba n wo ɓə gwo kwo, n zhni əwo əgwú n abye, wa vyi ɓəgbetu wa lo, kwo shikwonyi wo to ɓə kpe aba əye n wo lo m. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, wa mi əwo apyi dna n ɓəgbeshi əknyi ngye zhiɓeyi dna n əknyido; wo ɓə la dna n alubwi, ngye shi Ishakwu n Yakwuɓwui ɓa ɓə kwu fyi nyi, n ɓa ɓə kwnú əgwúgyiyi nu zhni n woi, tu n ɓəgbeshi gbmanyigbmanyi nyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ntuge wo ɓə n əwyei tu wa ɓwa əzhiyaakwo nu n kwo n ashnipai, n əkwo shiyi ɓədo n əkwo miyii nu zhni Shekwoyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, kwo Saratu, n wo ɓəə la du aɓyimasa ya nyi, wo ɓə myi waa aɓyi ma ntuge wo ɓə n Shekwoyi lá n zhni gaiciyazhninunui nu, n wo ɓəə lá ɓəgbeshi shi nyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ntulonu, n zagbmanyi ye, n wo ɓə gnyi ngye zafyi nyi, ayawyii ɓa kwnuɓe n bəgyei ngye akpasi əshebmana nya, jesnu ngye amwi n shikwogbe, n a taa shni ɓa ba m.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Aza ye vnyanya ɓa ɓə ye zhi ɓai gyianyì n gaiciyaganunui, əsa n ɓa ɓə fyí nyi. Ɓa to ɓə gwo anya n a ɓə zhi ɓa ɓəgbe nyi m; ɓa ɓə ɓwa ɓa əwyegyegye nu jesnu ɓa zhni ɓa amamba ń tagnyi, ɓai ye ge, ɓa ɓə zhni aknyidoda nu jesnu azhiɓeyi fyi n əknyi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Aza n ɓa da aɓo ye pya, ɓa wu nu nge ɓa zna əknyi shni lo n kwo zhni əɓa nya. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ɓa ɓə gna ɓa zhni əknyi nubwo nu n ɓa ɓə fa kwo nyi, ɓa ɓə ɓaa abaɓwa ɓa jezelo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />N əkwoɓwi, ɓa ɓə zhi n əknyi gnabmyai pwawoi nu; əshemi nya. Ntucenu Shekwoyi ta wo vnyinyikwo lo a yi wo ge əɓa Shekwoyi m, ntuge wo la əzhiyaakwo mi ga ɓa.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Ibrahim, she Shekwoyi ɓə mwi wo, waa Ishakwu ga n zhni nyagbmi. Əza n wo ɓə la gaiciyaga n aɓəgbeshi, wo ɓə ye wa ga əwo əɓyigba kəto n zhni nyagbmi nu, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />kwo shikwonyi Shekwoyi ɓə kwu gna wo, “Dna n Ishakwu əfye nu n a ɓə ba əho ayawyi.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ibrahim wa zhninubwo nge Shekwoyi ɓa myi wa la zafyi kala, jesnu nlonu dna n əwo ɓədada ye pya, waa Ishakwu je gwo ń əfyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, Ishakwu wa kpe Yakwuɓwu n Isuwai anabəlika ntu n əɓa anyìgyi abye nya ɓo.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Yakwuɓwu, she wo ɓə shi woi fyí, wa kpe Yusufu anugwnu anabəlika jesnu wa ga mwamwa n kpema gnyi n əwo bwusi.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Yusufu, she əwo əfyi əsa ɓə la wo vyivyiwyi, wa da Aisrailayi kwnukwnuya ɓo n Masar jesnu wa ga agbetu ntu n əwo asnukwnu byibyi ɓo.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Mwusa azamayi, ɓaa wo sodna apya ngwnu-ata ɓai la wo ma, ntuge ɓa ɓə gye nge wo to ɓo zhni əɓyi azanga nu m, jesnu to ɓa wo əsu ɓəznutu ədna m.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Mwusa, woi la mwa, waa aɓəna, to wa ye a yi wo ge Fyirauna nyigwnu nugwnu m. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Wa knyi a wu wo azhnìgye n kwnusnu n Shekwoyi azai, n du ədo n wo ɓa ɓwa agbmada aduduiya aleifyizhni nya.<verse eid="HEB 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Wa gye wyegbaci ntu Kirisiti ɓo n zhni gyiba apma gnadui nu tu n Masar nyaɓwa, ntuge wo ɓə gnyi woi tuwye n əwo gyiba nu n abye. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />N gaiciyaganunui nu wa fa Masar, to woi wó əsu minagyi ədna m; waa əmìfyi ntuge wo ɓə kwu əza gyewye n a ta gye wo əwye m. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, wa shi Gnanaznu əɓwa jesnu wa zhni apma n amii, nabai nge əza n wo wu aɓyikpmimai nyi, to wa to Israila aɓyikpmimai əɓwa m.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, aza ɓa pi Shikwo Byei ya ngye ɓa duya n əknyi-kawu; ama shi Amasariyi ɓə ye ɓa piya ce, ɓa kwu ɓwunuwna.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />N gaiciyaganunui nu, Jerikwo gəlu kwaa myiya, shi akwnuyi ɓə kwu shegwnu kwo anyipyei ngwnu-tnaaba.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />N gaiciyaganunui nu Raham kaluwa, ntuge wo ɓə la aknyiwyekayi gwo, a to ɓə wu wo n kwnusnu n aza yii n ɓa ɓə zhni atnaɓəgbetuvyiyi m.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Njesnu mi ɓa je knyiɓei nu da a? Mi to n əsai lo ma daɓo tu n Gidiyon, Barak, Samson, Jefta, n Dawuda tukwo, n Samwulai ɓədo n sheaɓəgwognayii m, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />aza, n gaiciyaganunui nu, ɓa gyi abemi n okwnui, ɓa zhni gaiciya ɓo; ɓa gwo anya n a ɓə zhi ɓa aɓəgbeshi nyi; ɓa kwu agaba agbe gwù, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />ɓaa əná gwogwoyi wnu jesnu ɓa kwu pwo əbeyaakwo; fyi n əɓa akalágba ɓa kwu kalá ɓwa, jesnu ɓa kwu zè akalada fyi n okwnusnu; jesnu ɓaa aknyido akwnuyii nyaya. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Anyikwoza ɓa je əɓa afyífyiyi gwo, a kwu ɓa kala zhi n wyewyeyii njesnu. Azaje ɓə nyi n a ɓə kwu azhnìgye wu ɓa, to ɓai ye ge a ya ɓa əɓwa m, nabai n ɓa ɓə ɓwa əfyikalakwu gnabmyai. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Azaho a kpe ɓa agyè njesnu a gyiɓanaya, azaho a kwu ɓa pa n agbmai, jesnu a kwu ɓa fyi n zhalu. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />A kwu ɓa wu ai knyi ɓa akwuta, aa ɓa gnajeya ngwnu-aba-aba n zolutoi; a kwu ɓa wu n abeyaakwoi. Ba zna laɓa n fyi n aknyi-apai pwi, n abwui-apai pwi, awyekwoyi, ai wu ɓa awyesnugbegye ɓo; jesnu ai wna ɓa əsnu; <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />anyì to ɓə kwnuce kwa shi ɓa m. Ɓa zna fyi n zhabwikawu n apei, ɓa ɓə fyi n abmi n aɓwoi n əknyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Əɓa vnyanya a ɓə kwu ɓa ci ntu əɓa gaiciyaganunui ɓo, dudulonu əzaho to ɓə nyi n ɓa, n wo ɓə la ənya gwo, n a ɓə shi ɓa əkwo əgbe nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Shikwonyi Shekwoyi ɓə n nyaho gnabmyaii mwushi ntu əyi ɓo, nabai nge n ɓwa kwnusnu n əyii nu, n a ɓə kwu ɓa zhni n anunui.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">La əwye ce n Yeisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi yi n aseyedada deeji yaakwo ye pyai lo n shegwnu yi nyi, fa ya kwu nyahonyahoi shnawoi sheya, n ɓa n yii zezhi nyi, jesnu n leifyii n kwo ta wo knanyi əza nyi m. Njesnu fa ya bwusi n bwugbadnai, əsi n kwo shi n əyi abye nyi. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Yi kwu əyi awyeknyi n Yeisu, əwo nu zhni gnabye jesnu əyi gaiciyaganunui nya. Ntuge a ɓə lá agbmada shi n əwo abye; waa əmìfyi n znudui, waa əkwo vnyinkwo gbmiya, jesnu waa sasetu n Shekwoyi əbeshnikpegye ɓwaizheɓwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Yi pa wo əɓo, əza n wo ɓə fyimì n aleifyizhniyii pyai n ɓa ɓə gnyiapaapa n woi nyi, nabai to fya gbakalá jesnu fya bmabwugba ya m.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shekwoyi tá əwo aɓyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Fyi n əfye okwnusnu n leifyii, fye too na kwo aɓo, kwoi si aba n fye ɓa zè əfye ami ya m. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Njesnu fye kwu ɓədagbma bwugbakaladna nya ye zamwi nu kpeekpe, n kwo daɓo n fyei shi əda daɓo n wo nugwnui nyi i? Kwo gna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Əmi nugwnu, to la Dagayi tata la faafa m,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">jesnu to bma əho ədu ya əsa n wo gnaknyi ho ncei m,<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />ntuge Dagayi tá əza nu n wo ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">njesnu wo gnaknyi zahozahoyi n wo gwo ngye əwo nugwnu.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Fye kwu əmìfyi n azhnìgyei kwaa zhni tata; Shekwoyi shi fye ngye əwo aɓyi nu. Ntuge knyi əɓyi nu lo n əwo dada ta tá wo ma a? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />N a ta tá fye lo; shi zahozahoyii gwo tata m; a gye fye to zhni akwnusnuyi nu m, anugwnu ɓədo n anyigwnu ahnihnii m, nanyinanyi. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Nshnisnusnu, əyi vnyanya yi ɓə kwu adada nayi nya ɓwa n ɓa ɓəə ta yi jesnu yi ɓə kwu mwamwa ga ɓa ntuce. A gye, yi ɓa gna əyihni gaga nu, n Dada azafnu nya akwnu nabai ya pwo! <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Ba ta yi n əsai fyewyi shi ɓa gye kwo gnadu n bmyabmya; ama Shekwoyi ta yi ntu n əyihni bmyabmya ɓo nu, nabai n yi ɓa ɓwa əwo gyigyi. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Tata ho to lo n kwo dagbma nsayii m, ama kwo snasnai. N tata avnu, kwo zhni kwa ga gyigyi n əkwo nu zhni ɓəfyece n bwugbafui, ga aza yi n ɓa kwu mwutu ɓwa n kwoi nyi.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Ntucenu, fye fyi əfye aɓwagbma kalá ɓədo n anyikwutukwo akalágbayii. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />“Fye zhni əfye awogye aba ntu n əfye apitabwada ɓo,” nabai n zabmazhi taa zè kalágbayi m, nkwoɓwi wa ɓwa kágna.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɓəkwnukwnù ɓədo n bwugbakaládnai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Fye la əfyenyi yi fya sase n zahozahoyii n bwugbafui jesnu fya kwu zhi n gyigyiyi; ntuge n tna gyigyi əzaho to lo n wo ɓə gye Dagayi əwye m. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Fye la əwyewna nabai to zahozahoyi waa gbàgbà, wa ɓwi Shekwoyi shebmyashi nuwna m, jesnu kwo ge gbegye nukwoi ho, kwa kpeɓe kwa zhni aza mwa bəgyé ɓa gyeazhnì jesnu kwa tu ɓa cegye m. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Fye la əwyewna to a gye ge əzahozahoyi n zhni asisiɓozhniyi nu m, kwo tnashekwodnawoyi ngye Isuwa m, n wo ɓə la əwo əgwú əɓyi kpmisnuyi nya kwnu ntu n nyagyi znugbmanyi ɓo nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />N dəye avnu, shi fye kpəlo nyi, she wo ɓə ye wa gyi əgwú ye, a ɓə la əwo aɓəna. Kwo shikwonyi wo ɓə zna anabəlika ye shni n awyenyii, wo to ɓə myi wa shna ənya ədo n wo ɓə kwu zhni nyi m.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Əpe ədnawo nya n əpe bwugbabwui nyai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Fye to ɓe əpe nu n a ɓa to kwo əɓwa kwo əná-gwogwoi aba m; kwo wyegbma aba, kwo aba n ɓa wu duludulu, kwo vnuvnu aba m, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />kwo lo da knaknaci əɓwi, kwo bəgye yi pya n kwo kwnu aɓədagbma ga aza yi n ɓa ɓə wo kwo nyi; ɓa ɓà nge a to gwodu n ɓədagbma yi da ga ɓa m, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />ntuge ɓa to ɓə myi ɓa shi ɓəgbetu əɓwa n a ɓə ga ɓa nyi m: “Kwo nyakpa nu n kwa to əpe yi, ɓəshishi nu a knyi kwo akwuta kwa fyí.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Əkwo awyeshishi ɓə wodna wowoi zam, kwa zhni Mwusa n əwohni wa gna, “Mi gnyi n vnyivnyii nu ɓədo n ədnai.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ama fye kwu ɓe Siyona Əpe, Shekwoyi wyewyeyida əzhiyaakwo, əshemi Urishelima. Fye kwu ɓe da amaləka adugwu kpe adugwu, fyi n bwugbabwui adogwnuba, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />fye kwu ɓe da ikilisiya əɓyi kpmisnuyi nya, aza n əɓa aye kafyilo n əshemi. Fye kwu ɓe Shekwoyi aba, owadayi aza vnyanya nya, fye kwu ɓe da azafnu aɓəfyeceyi nya n a kwu ɓa zhni anunui, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Fye kwu ɓe Yeisu aba n əwo nu zhni ɓəwnazhiyi ɓəgbeshi woiwoyi nya, jesnu da ami myímyíi, n kwo da ɓədagbma gnabmyai n du Habyila ami nyi.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Fye la əwyewna to fya na əza aɓo n wo daɓo nyi m. Ngye ɓa to ɓə pwo, əsa n ɓa ɓə na əwo aɓo, n wo ɓə ga ɓa ɓəkwnukwnù dna n anyì nyi m; əyi, yi ɓə gnapwopwo n wunanu, n ya pmyiya n wo, n wo ga yi ɓəkwnukwnù dna n əshemi nyi a? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Dna n əsa yi, əwo bəgye ɓə kwu əknyi jeashna, ama nsaiye wo la ɓəgbeshi shi, “N kpmasnu znugbmanyi, mi to ɓə ɓwa anyì nu ashnaje m, ama ɓədo n ashebmanai ce.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Aɓədagbma ye, “N kpmasnu znugbmanyi” Kwo wu nge, a la anya kwnuya n ɓa ɓá jashna; ngye, anya azhnizhniyi, nabai anya n ɓa taa jashna m ɓa kwu cezhi.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Ntucenu, shikwonyi yi ta gwo əbemi nu n kwo ɓa jashna m, fa ya kwu zhni amisayi, ntulonu ya ga Shekwoyi mwamwa gwogwoi n ədnai n ɓəwowoi, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />ntuge əyi “Shekwoyi zhni əná ənyanagyii nu.”<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bwugbakaladna ɓəkwnu kpmasnui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Azanugbai n anyikwozai, fye gwodu fyei wu aje yeye. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Fye to zamwi, n azhiɓeyishii m, ntuge ɓəzhni ye pya nu zhni aza ɓa shi amaləka to ɓai kpe m. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Fye gwodu fyei pa aza yi ɓo n ɓa fyilo n zhalu nyi, ngye fye kwnufyi lo n ɓai nu. Njesnu aza yi n a wna ɓa əsnu ngye fye gyeazhnì lo n fyehni.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Aza vnyanya ɓa ga mwula mwamwa, jesnu mwula gədo kwaa gnyi n tnadodnai, ntuge Shekwoyi ɓəə da anagbáizhniyi owa ɓədo n asisiɓozhniyii vnyanya. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Fye kwu əfyehni wnashi n anyìgyi gyiwye yeye nya, jesnu anya n fye ncei lo ɓa kwu fye kwnuawye, ntuge Shekwoyi wo kwu da,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:5">“Mi taa ya fye m nanyinanyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:5">Mi taa na fye aɓo m nanyinanyi.”<verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ntulonu yi daɓo n agwumyii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Dagayi zhni əmi bmazhniyi nu; mi taa wodna m.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">Knyiyi nu n zanyikwoci azanga ɓa zhni mi a?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Fye pa əfye agnabye ɓo, n ɓa ɓə da fye Shekwoyi ɓədagbma nyi. Fye dnawye fya gye shi ɓa ɓə gyianyì n wu jesnu fya shna əɓa gaiciyaganunui. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yeisu Kirisiti zhni gbmanyigbmanyi nu, nsu n kwo duiya nyi, n naiye jesnu nyalonyalo.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Fye to ye a kwu fye fyi n anyìgyi azhiɓeyi nyawu adəhodəhoi pya m. Kwo bmyalo əyi adu ɓa kwu akalá fyi ntu n shebmyashi ɓo, toge tu n akwnunu nyagyi ɓo m, n kwo to n apmai lo ga aza yi n ɓa gyi nyi m. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Yi n bəgədii lo n aza yi n ɓa zhni ɓəvyitnutnu n dagayilubwui nyi, ɓa to n ikwoi lo ɓa gyi n kwo m.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Pirisiti dnagbmai, wo kwu anyakpa ami lo ncei n Aba Gyigyiyi Duduyi nu, n zhni aleifyi nyaga, ama a kpe əɓa anayi əná zhi n apyiznudna əbmyi nu. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ntulonu Yeisu wa gyeazhnì gnyi n əzhiyaakwo əbmyi nabai wa kwu aza zhni agyigyiyi n əwo amii. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Nlonu, fa əyi, ya lo da wo zhi n apyiznudna əbmyi, yii kwnu vnyinkwo wo n woi. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Ntuge yi to n əzhiyaakwo nyalonyalo nyai lo n ya m, ama yi n awyetui lo n əzhiyaakwo nu n kwo ɓe lo nyi.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Ntucenu dna n Yeisu, fa ya gwodu yii ga Shekwoyi nyagbmi cici nya; gyigyiga əyi agbe nya, ɓa da əwo əye ɓo pəipəi. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Njesnu fye to zamwi fya zhni əɓo manai jesnu fya ce anya ga aje m, ntuge nyaga ye pya nu dá Shekwoyi agbma.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Fye kwu bwugba ga əfye agnabyeda jesnu fya kwu əfyehni ga fyi n əɓa ikwo, ntuge ɓa shi fye awye ngye aza yi nu n kwo zhni ɓəshishi nu ɓai ga nyadokwu. Fye zhni dəye nabai n ɓa ɓá zhni tnutnu n bwugbabwui, toge n awyicei m, ntuge dəye to n apmai lo n əfye aba m.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Fye zhniaduwa ga yi. Yi kpəlo nge yi n tukwovnyi manai lo, jesnu yi n pwawoi lo ya gyianyì n kwnu mwamwaga dna n zokwo dəhodəhoi. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Mi gna fye ɓəhnihni nge fye zhniaduwa nabai n a ɓa mi gbmiya ga fye ntna əsagyiyi.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anabəlika n gnaɓyi kpmasnuii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nsaiye fa Shekwoyi bwugbafu nya, əza n wo ɓə zhniapma n ami ɓəgbeshi nyalonyalo nyai, wa la əyi Dagayi Yeisu kala n əfyi, aknyi Knyiknayi yaakwo yi, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />wo la agwu ye fye, n anya amanaii nabai fya zhni əwo ɓəye, jesnu fa wa myi wa zhni tnutnu dna n yi, ədo pya n əkwo əɓo da wo, dna n Yeisu Kirisiti, n latu zhni əwo nya nu nyalonyalo. Aamyi.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Azanugbai n anyikwozai, mi tna fye aɓwa, jesnu mi ɓa fye lo nge fye ɓwa bwugba n əmi ɓədagbma bwugbakaladna nyai, ntuge ɓəhnihni, mi ɓə kwu ənya ka ga fye pyikwnu.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mi ye fya kpe nge a la əyido Timoti loya. N wa jezeɓe n pye, mi ɓə ɓe n woi wa gye fye əwye.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Fye la agnabye vnyanya ɓyigna ɓədo n Dagayi azai vnyanya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 13:24">Aza yi n ɓa kwnu n Itali nyi, ɓa tnu fye gnaɓyi lo.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Shebmyashi kwo kwnusnu n əfyei vnyanya.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>